  "sections": [
   "This is Tuli, the company you work for.",
   "They own you, and you work because you have no choice.",
   "Your job: clear out areas of UGVs and worse.",
   "Fighting machines is brutal.",
   "The only way to win is to fight dirty.",
   "So do that."
