   "Hold RMB to straf.",
   "This detaches your gun from your camera. You make CC by killing while straf.",
   "X to aim.",
   "Not recommended.",
   "C to prone.",
   "Lowers visibility for UGVs, and especially drones.",
   "V for radar.",
   "Lets you find and target enemies."
  ]
